---
# LinApple .clang-tidy configuration
#
# This project favors a procedural, C-like C++11 style as mandated in AGENTS.md.
# We utilize the following exclusions from standard C++ Core Guidelines:
#
# 1. pro-type-vararg & avoid-variadic-functions:
#    Favoring printf-style formatting over iostream for performance,
#    conciseness in hex-formatting, and C99 ABI compatibility.
#
# 3. avoid-magic-numbers & macro-usage:
#    Hardware emulation uses address ranges, register masks, bitshifts,
#    and compiler attribute formatting macros.
#
# 4. easily-swappable-parameters & use-enum-class:
#    Procedural C/C++11 ABI APIs with integer IDs and primitive parameters.

Checks: '-*,misc-include-cleaner,bugprone-use-after-move,bugprone-unhandled-self-assignment,bugprone-suspicious-string-compare,bugprone-sizeof-expression,bugprone-dangling-handle,bugprone-undefined-memory-manipulation'
WarningsAsErrors: 'misc-include-cleaner'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'src/.*'
